ice reports to the bucket named in the EXPORT_BUCKET environment variable. Be careful in staging: there, EXPORT_BUCKET points at the production bucket, a leftover from the 2025 migration. Never run scripts/export.py against staging without --dry-run, or staging data overwrites the real prod reports.", "numLines": 3, "totalLines": 3}}
